        "en": "Reviewers emphasize the careful and calm handling provided to both canine and feline clients in Astoria. Multiple cat owners specifically praise groomers for managing delicate breeds like Ragdolls without stress. One passerby expressed concern regarding evening barking, but patrons consistently describe their animals as content."
