        "en": "Customers consistently highlight the pleasant and accommodating attitude of the front-desk and grooming staff. Reviewers appreciate that the team readily squeezes in last-minute nail trims and works around busy weekend routines. Communication is generally praised, though one client reported a miscommunicated grooming request."
